%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b8c5f8bea1b438d4687ad9b712e77c3e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level 1-11 Start
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CutsceneData
  line:
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 618ec32722d755e4e80a7f213a9d80b0, type: 2}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: "I lived in the third floor of a corner lodging house not very far
      from the University; I put the finishing touches to what I previously wrote
      on my novel, and there I wrote the latter half of \u201CNoli Me Tangere\u201D
      The German influence, and absence from the Philippines for so long a time,
      had modified my early radical views, and the book had now become less an effort
      to arouse the Spanish sense of justice than a means of education for Filipinos
      by pointing out their shortcomings."
    isLeftSide: 1
    pose: 1
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 618ec32722d755e4e80a7f213a9d80b0, type: 2}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: "The printer of \u201CNoli Me Tangere\u201D lived in a neighboring
      street, and, like most printers in Germany, worked for a very moderate compensation,
      so that the volume of over four hundred pages cost less than a fourth of what
      it would have done in England, or one half of what it would cost in economical
      Spain."
    isLeftSide: 1
    pose: 1
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 618ec32722d755e4e80a7f213a9d80b0, type: 2}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: Yet even at such a modest price, I was delayed in the publication until
      one fortunate morning he received a visit from a countryman, Doctor Maximo
      Viola, who invited me to take a pedestrian trip. I responded that my interests
      kept me in Berlin at that time as I was awaiting funds from home with which
      to publish a book I had just completed, and showed him the manuscript.
    isLeftSide: 1
    pose: 1
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 618ec32722d755e4e80a7f213a9d80b0, type: 2}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: Doctor Viola was very interested and offered to use the money he had
      put aside for the trip to help pay the publisher. So the work went ahead, and
      when the delayed remittance from my family arrived, I repaid the obligation.
      Then we sallied forth on our trip
    isLeftSide: 1
    pose: 1
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 618ec32722d755e4e80a7f213a9d80b0, type: 2}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: After a considerable tour of the historic spots and scenic places in
      Germany, we arrived at Dresden, where I was warmly greeted by Doctor A. B.
      Meyer, the Director of the Royal Saxony Ethnographical Institute. He was an
      authority upon Philippine matters, for some years before he had visited the
      Islands to make a study of the people. With a countryman resident in the Philippines,
      Doctor Meyer made careful and thorough scientific investigations, and his conclusions
      were more favorable to the Filipinos than the published views of many of the
      unscientific Spanish observers
    isLeftSide: 1
    pose: 1
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 618ec32722d755e4e80a7f213a9d80b0, type: 2}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: In Austrian territory we first visited Doctor Ferdinand Blumentritt,
      whom I had known by reputation for many years and with whom I had long corresponded
      through regular exchange of letters.
    isLeftSide: 1
    pose: 1
  - speakerName: Ferdinand Blumentritt
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b24d169703cccb744be0cce9c4863fb5, type: 2}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: My dear friend! We finally met at last! How long have I wished to meet
      you!
    isLeftSide: 0
    pose: 1
  - speakerName: 
    speakerType: 2
    hero: {fileID: 0}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: The two friends greet each other with a deep strong hug and continue
      on with their conversation.
    isLeftSide: 0
    pose: 0
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 618ec32722d755e4e80a7f213a9d80b0, type: 2}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: Likewise my dear friend! I have truly enjoyed our exchanges, sharing
      fervent discussion
    isLeftSide: 1
    pose: 1
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 618ec32722d755e4e80a7f213a9d80b0, type: 2}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: Likewise my dear friend! I have truly enjoyed our exchanges, sharing
      fervent discussion
    isLeftSide: 1
    pose: 1
  - speakerName: Ferdinand Blumentritt
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b24d169703cccb744be0cce9c4863fb5, type: 2}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: Come, come! Let me show you around!
    isLeftSide: 0
    pose: 1
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 618ec32722d755e4e80a7f213a9d80b0, type: 2}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: We stayed at the Hotel Roderkrebs, but were guests at the table of
      the Austrian professor, whose wife gave them appetizing demonstrations of the
      characteristic cookery of Hungary.
    isLeftSide: 1
    pose: 2
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 618ec32722d755e4e80a7f213a9d80b0, type: 2}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: I was very much interested in a gathering of tourists, arranged to
      make known the beauties of that picturesque region, sometimes called the Austrian
      Switzerland, and I delivered an address upon this occasion. I anticipate that
      there is a present interest in attracting tourists to the Philippines as an
      economic benefit to the country.
    isLeftSide: 1
    pose: 2
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 618ec32722d755e4e80a7f213a9d80b0, type: 2}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: I enjoyed my time with finally meeting a very dear friend of mine.
      At first, we just instinctively knew who we were looking for. We discussed
      many things, not just Philippine matters. Among these discussions, I drew a
      simple pencil sketch of my dear friend, in hopes that I would remember him.
      I do hope that Mr. Maximo enjoyed himself as I did.
    isLeftSide: 1
    pose: 1
